false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"I5C"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4cc0ce10-9413-457a-a658-e7f64d749b0f","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"しかし、ボストック氏は「無給のメンテナーがあらゆる問題に対して即座に応じなければならない」というムードがGitHubなどのプラットフォームに漂っていることを問題視しています。「全ての人を助けることを目標にする必要はありません。ユーザーからのフィードバックに対応しようとして気分が悪くなったり、建設的な意見でないと感じたりした場合は、対応を中断してもかまいません」と述べ、余裕をもってツールの開発に取り組むことを推奨しています。","ts":"1616389944.382800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"m9Dx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b69c9df5-77b7-4093-8667-e448e606ceb2","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"知見情報です","ts":"1616389725.382500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LiXw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"69124a3b-ba53-4bca-9dac-9ecc9f16eb1d","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"\u003chttps://gigazine.net/amp/20210321-d3-developer-learned|https://gigazine.net/amp/20210321-d3-developer-learned\u003e","ts":"1616389714.382000","attachments":[{"fallback":"GIGAZINE: 世界中で利用される「D3.js」の開発者が10年間で学んだこととは？","id":1,"title":"世界中で利用される「D3.js」の開発者が10年間で学んだこととは？","title_link":"https://gigazine.net/amp/20210321-d3-developer-learned","text":"ニューヨーク・タイムズやOpenStreetMapなど、さまざまなウェブサイトで利用されているデータ可視化ライブラリが「D3.js」です。そんなD3.jsの開発10周年を記念して、開発者のマイク・ボストック氏が「D3.jsを10年間開発する中で学んだこと」を公開しています。","image_url":"https://i.gzn.jp/img/2021/03/21/d3-developer-learned/00.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"GIGAZINE","service_icon":"https://gigazine.net/apple-touch-icon.png","from_url":"https://gigazine.net/amp/20210321-d3-developer-learned","original_url":"https://gigazine.net/amp/20210321-d3-developer-learned"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"goodpoem","count":2,"users":["U7B4ZD49X","U016GRZN0GJ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"k71Zw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cb9991c8-8b4f-41a4-a857-d5bb17f2244d","type":"message","user":"US90LD360","text":"自分がはじめてHHKB知って買ったの、いつかの技術書典のKoRoNさんのスパルタンVimがきっかけだったな","ts":"1616384763.380400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"ninja-doron","count":1,"users":["U017BU3UZBQ"]},{"name":"goodpoem","count":1,"users":["U06BRP8VD"]},{"name":"ari","count":1,"users":["U06BRP8VD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"T=3tP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d900245e-7ae9-4a00-af92-d98bf35d6908","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"gadgetチャンネルで少し前HHKBが毎週売れてたのはヤバいと思った:spin_keizai:","ts":"1616384259.379100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"e=i0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"F5371A75-0F79-4C06-8637-13CB1F413533","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"でも、最後を2HHKBくらい買っちゃったに直すと、普通の日常になるので、ある意味やばい。","ts":"1616380399.375800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Prf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"75b1929e-1f3d-498f-a234-2936f7b6b768","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"合計金額100は行っていそう","ts":"1616380395.375700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"y6eaR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"65b60d82-abc8-4705-b79a-a33a771428b9","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"50HHKBはやばい","ts":"1616380382.375000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yTqSQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"AF4A75B8-B454-43F6-8AB8-C9B6886F3187","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"確かに50HHKBは多いな","ts":"1616380096.373800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"flKZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"433F41CF-CD2C-400C-9A29-9699D69008B4","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"\u0026gt; 会員同士のやりとりがかなり激しくて『こんなにみんなHHKB買ってるの？』って感じだった。最初は『1HHKBくらいだったら買ってもいいかな』と思った。それがきっかけ」\n\u0026gt; 「今すぐ買え！今すぐ買え！みたいな感じでかなり煽ってきて。『じゃあもうちょっと買っておこう』みたいな。気付けば最終的に50HHKBくら